                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79f7f5b7-6671-465c-a11f-d661af970335",
                                                "sense_id": "e849c03b-5eef-31e8-be67-566da8997587",
                                                "text": "economy of word"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0cde0ee-03b8-4c91-8a82-2088ec444cd4",
                                                "sense_id": "e849c03b-5eef-31e8-be67-566da8997587",
                                                "text": "April 5, 1729, Jonathan Swift, letter to St. John\nI have no other notion of economy than that it is the parent to liberty and ease."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "200476bb-8786-4d34-bf72-9108c275323e",
                                                "sense_id": "e849c03b-5eef-31e8-be67-566da8997587",
                                                "text": "Every possible economy was carefully investigated and unnecessary expense, however small, eliminated. The company had no money to spare on \"frills.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56b81383-8b6d-361b-b564-5fe9ec151978",
                                        "entry_id": "735e19ab-8c7d-3e70-8806-62de3fcd2d73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The system of production and distribution and consumption. The overall measure of a currency system; as the national economy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d54956f9-5265-48fe-8f41-389fb5dc3cbf",
                                                "sense_id": "56b81383-8b6d-361b-b564-5fe9ec151978",
                                                "text": "An economy open to free movement of capital can keep a fixed exchange rate, for example, only by subjugating monetary-policy goals to its defence—by raising interest rates sharply, say, when capital outflows put downward pressure on the currency. Yet the trilemma also implies that an economy can enjoy both free capital flows and an independent monetary policy, so long as it gives up worrying about its exchange rate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b862275c-1fe5-3644-9c91-32b1a7283946",
                                        "entry_id": "735e19ab-8c7d-3e70-8806-62de3fcd2d73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The method of divine government of the world. (See Economy (religion) on Wikipedia.Wikipedia.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2455b125-6ca8-4a62-a4fa-f2df0ca45320",
                                                "sense_id": "b862275c-1fe5-3644-9c91-32b1a7283946",
                                                "text": "The economy of God is in Jesus Christ alone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
